#: app/templates/terms.html:18
msgid "Service Provided As-Is"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:19
msgid ""
"Expense Manager is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\" without "
"warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. We do not guarantee "
"that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or meet your specific"
" requirements. Use of the service is at your own risk."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:23
msgid "Your Data and Responsibility"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:24
msgid ""
"You are solely responsible for the accuracy and completeness of the "
"expense data you enter. Expense Manager is a personal finance tracking "
"tool and does not provide financial, tax, or legal advice. You should "
"verify all financial records independently and consult qualified "
"professionals when needed."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:28
msgid "Prohibited Uses"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:29
msgid "You agree not to use Expense Manager to:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:31
msgid ""
"Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the service or other users' "
"accounts."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:32
msgid ""
"Use the service for any unlawful purpose or in violation of applicable "
"laws."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:33
msgid ""
"Interfere with or disrupt the service infrastructure or other users' "
"access."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:34
msgid "Scrape, harvest, or collect data from the service without permission."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:35
msgid ""
"Share your account credentials with others or allow unauthorized use of "
"your account."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:40
msgid "Account Termination"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:41
msgid ""
"We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time if "
"you violate these Terms of Service or engage in prohibited activities. "
"You may also delete your account at any time. Upon termination, your "
"right to use the service ceases immediately, and your data will be "
"deleted in accordance with our Privacy Policy."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:45
msgid "Changes to These Terms"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/terms.html:46
msgid ""
"We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. Continued use of "
"the service after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the "
"revised terms. We encourage you to review this page periodically."
msgstr ""

